  "_meta": {
    "description": "Multi-step permission-freshness sequences (Milestone 6 design section 7/13). Each sequence runs against the shared evaluation seed, mutates one permission row, re-queries, then the runner restores the exact original state before the next sequence or case runs — see backend/src/app/evaluation/freshness.py. The restore step is computed automatically from the mutation (not authored here) so it can never drift out of sync.",
    "mutation_actions": ["revoke_group_membership", "grant_group_membership", "revoke_document_acl"]
